{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2021-02-03 07:00:00', 'title': 'STERIS ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP SUCCESSION PLAN', 'text': "DUBLIN, IRELAND, FEB. 03, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT WALT ROSEBROUGH, PRESIDENT AND CEO, HAS ANNOUNCED HIS INTENTION TO STEP DOWN ON JULY 29, 2021, IN CONJUNCTION WITH THE COMPANY'S ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING. MR. ROSEBROUGH WILL REMAIN AS CEO EMERITUS AND SENIOR ADVISOR TO STERIS'S LEADERSHIP AND BOARD FOR THE NEXT TWO YEARS."}